Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:06.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《猩球崛起》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 好的… 现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, okay… now…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是哪只？9号？- 是的 9号 亮眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which one's this, number9? - Yeah, number 9. Bright eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you watching this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这简直是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, this is unbelieveable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他用了几步？- 20步\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many moves was that? - 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,最完美的做法是15步 天啊 你给她吃了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The perfect score is 15. God, what, what are you giving her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 把那个录像给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, give me that video!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,9号大猩猩 我们只给了她一剂药剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chimp number 9, just one dose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能等等来吗？- 我们已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Couldn't I see you later? - We're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会儿再打给你 嗯 好的 谢谢 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to call you back. Yeah, all right. Thanks, Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,112号药剂 它有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}112, it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是在一只灵长类动物身上生效？- 一只就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On just the one primate? - One is all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,认知能力的完全恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full cognitive recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定自己没有太心急吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, are you sure you're not rushing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经研究这个五年半了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working on this for five and a half years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些数据很清楚了 我们准备好了 史蒂芬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The data is clear. We're ready, Steven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就差你批准人体试验了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need is your approval for human trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个啊 你需要董事会的批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for this, you're going to need the Board's approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个项目上投资了很多钱 威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of money riding on this, Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只有一次机会 - 一次就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You only get one shot. - One shot is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我需要看你所有的研究成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll need to see all the research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有 威尔… - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, and Will… - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把你的私人感情牵涉进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your personal emotions out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人投资要看到成果 而不是梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people invest in results, not dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来见见9号猩猩 她正在完成一个叫卢卡斯塔的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet chimp 9. Here she's tasking at what is called the Lucas Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个游戏的目标是要把这个塔从一根柱子移到另一根柱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The object of which is to move the tower from peg to peg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个过程中大盘不能放在小盘上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}without placing a larger block on top of a smaller block.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我们预料的一样 她完全无法完成这个谜题\N{\fnArial\fs30}As expected, she was unable to complete the puzzle at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来 我们给她注射了名为ALZ-112的药物 这是一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we gave her what we call, ALZ-112, a gene therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让大脑创造细胞进行自我修复的基因药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that allows the brain to create its own cells in order to repair itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生物学中 这叫神经形成\N{\fnArial\fs30}In biology, this is called neurogenesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 在GEN-SYS\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, at GEN-SYS,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把它叫做治疗老年痴呆症的神药\N{\fnArial\fs30}we call it a cure to Alzheimer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唐尼 你让她准备好了吗？- 她怯场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Donnie, you get her ready? - She's got stage fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要把我的手都弄断了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna break my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮眼睛！放手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bright Eyes! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经准备好进入下一阶段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready to move on to the next phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,人体试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.79,0:06:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 亮眼睛 你最爱的气泡苏打水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, Bright Eyes. It's your favorite fizzy soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 准备好 唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go, Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把她搞到楼下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have her downstairs already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好姑娘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来吧 姑娘 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out, girl, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.55,0:06:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐尼 把笼子打开！打开！打开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donnie, open the cage! Open up! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.53,0:06:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给她打镇定剂了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going to sedate her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要！- 把门关上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no! - Get the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！等等！就现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! Hold it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫支援！唐尼 唐尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call help! Donnie, Donnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前112号药剂只出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been absolutely no side effects associated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}with 112, with one exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于某种原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,猩猩的虹膜上出现了绿色的斑点\N{\fnArial\fs30}the chimps irises exhibit flecks of green.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我们最初是在9号猩猩上注意到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we first noticed it in chimp 9,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才给它起了「亮眼睛」这个外号\N{\fnArial\fs30}hence her nickname, Bright Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿你们就会看到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see when we bring her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上 这种药物可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}In theory, this therapy can be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,治疗很多不同种类的脑科疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}to treat a wide range of brain disorders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的潜力是无限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's virtually limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给我们带来巨大的收益\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are the potential profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why we are confident that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会批准人体试验的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will vote to approve human trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:07:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布斯先生 雅各布斯先生 我求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Jacobs, Mr. Jacobs I am begging you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你了 别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am begging you, not to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 其实只要花一小笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it costs a small fortune to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以给这些猩猩做一个检测\N{\fnArial\fs30}run lab workups on all of those chimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.78,0:08:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但结果显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to tell me what I already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们都被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they are contaminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事关它们的生命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are lives at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些动物有个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}These, these are animals with personalities,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}with attachments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感情？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Attachments? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是在做生意 不是在开宠物园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I run a a business, not a petting zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.07,0:08:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,用最省钱的方式把这些猩猩杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the most cost effective way to put those apes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是猩猩管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the chimp handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂芬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚的事真有趣！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把112号药剂带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've taken the 112.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,董事会驳回了你的提案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Board has rejected your proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们选择开发别的项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've chosen to advance other programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总能做点什么的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there must be something that you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我可以把你炒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. There is, I could fire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我们已经谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, we talked about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有五年令人信服的数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have five years of conclusive data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些数据随便你怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parade all the data you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也无法说服任何人对你投资了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will never convince anyone to invest another dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种药有救命的潜力！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This drug has the potential to save lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是让公司破产的潜力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bankrupt this company, more like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 你对人类大脑了解得那么透彻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, you know everything about the human brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:08:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就是不知道别人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}except the way it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头开始研究112号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to the drawing board on the 112.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,从分子阶段重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start again in molecular development.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着在别人研究出来之前成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a way to get there before someone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 收拾好这烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franklin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只很小 我们把她带来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very small. She must have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定已经怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pregnant when we brought her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她才…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是进攻性强 她只是想保护她的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't being aggressive. She was just being protective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为我们想伤害她的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thought we were going to hurt her baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想自己领养它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would take it myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我小舅子在保安处工作 他肯定会把我供出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my brother-in-law works for security. He'd rat me out in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我领养它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you want me to take it home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么照顾猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take care of a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不是猴子！他是猩猩 - 富兰克林…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not a monkey! He's an ape. - Franklin…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要照顾他几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's just for a couple days until.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到一个避难所 这就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find a sanctuary. That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林 不行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franklin, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的责任范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this isn't my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是公司财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, this is company property.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you what, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布斯让我把另外12只都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacobs made me put down the other 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你请便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！- 哦 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看上去精神不好 - 是啊 他怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look beat. - Yeah. How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,时好时坏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he has good days and bad days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不怎么样 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, not so good, although he.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始背诵莎士比亚的剧本了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been quoting Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你搞来了一只宠物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他只在我们家暂时留宿几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's just a temporary house guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许这对他有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe that'll be good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔！我没听见你进门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will! I didn't hear you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就今天了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today's the day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会忘记吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought I'd forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天有场大考 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a big test today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,化学？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chemistry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你看样东西怎么样？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to see something? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？他 受伤了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? Is he injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得那是胎记\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think that's a birthmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「对凯撒 只有跪下 跪伏并惊叹！」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"As for Caesar, kneel down, kneel down and wonder!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太投入感情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't get too attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真可爱 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a cute little guy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车钥匙呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my car keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车钥匙 你把它们放哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My car keys, where'd you put 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸… 你已经不开车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, …you a, you don't drive anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.61,0:13:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来喂他吧 你会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you feed him. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I can…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔！快来看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will! Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他多大了？一天？两天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old is he? Like, a day old? Two days old?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真聪明 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a smart one, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算给他取什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to name him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 凯撒展现了非常高的智力水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, Caesar displayed signs of heightened intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我收养了他 然后开始在家里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I kept him. And, brought my work home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,十八个月后 凯撒认识24个单词了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By 18 months, Caesar was signing up to 24 words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,两岁时 凯撒可以完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}By age two, Caesar completing puzzles and models.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为八岁及以上的儿童设计的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}designed for children eight years and up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,三岁时\N{\fnArial\fs30}At age three,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒继续展现高超的认知技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar continues to show cognative skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.99,0:15:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,比同龄人类都要强\N{\fnArial\fs30}that far exceed that of his human counterpart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,家… 家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home… home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以15步的满分成绩完成了卢卡斯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He completed the Lucas Tower in 15 moves, a perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是有几个假设：一 他眼睛中的绿色斑点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I maintain my hypothesis that: A. The green in his eyes indicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明了ALZ-112从母亲遗传到了孩子身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the ALZ-112 was passed genetically from mother to son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 由于大脑中没有受到损伤的细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, B. That in the absence of damaged cells that need to be replacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他体内的药物刺激了他的大脑功能快速发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}the drug in his system has radically boosted healthy brain functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他下象棋很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}he plays chess pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 我再也做不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - I can't do this, anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该被送到养老院里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He belongs in a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:15:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他根本没法过\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no way for him to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没法过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把灯都打破了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke my lamp…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让你好起来的 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll make you better, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶德 进来吃早饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Todd, come inside for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记录我从实验室带来的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need to keep track of what I take from the lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我觉得你一个月注射一次就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}although I don't see you needing more than one treatment a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太神奇了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something amazing has happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要做个血液测试 一次扫描…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need a blood test, a scan and the dosage…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得控制用药量\N{\fnArial\fs30}carefully monitored.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能溜进…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if I can sneak…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.97,0:18:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔！我已经好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will! I'm not sick, anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was nothing, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:19:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 凯撒在哪？我要见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ceasar. Where's Caesar? I want to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定没有走远\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't have gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去！滚出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿… 够了！够了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey… Enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果再让我发现有动物出现在我家门口 或者接近我的孩子们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I catch that animal anywhere near my house or my kids, again…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有下次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不会了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right, it won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 爸 - 他只是想玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Dad. - He, he just wanted to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在家里！爸爸保护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in the house! Daddy's got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说不要一个人出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to go out without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况多糟糕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他喜欢你 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He likes you. - Uh, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 马上就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. It'll be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.65,0:20:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们一起去搞点东西吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we can go get a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 冰淇淋怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking, ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.55,0:20:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教他打手语？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught him to sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只教了一些基础的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, handful of things, basic stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你觉得我们什么时候该来复诊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when do you think we should come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不用再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you won't need to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些线是可溶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because, um, the stiches are dissolveable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意一下有没有感染的症状就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would just say, watch for signs of infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,发烧啊… 发红啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fever… redness…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.89,0:21:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他现在在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what's he saying, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我们俩应该一起吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}he thinks that you and I should have dinner together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.79,0:21:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… know…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.23,0:21:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛琳 又见到你了 真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you, again, Caroline.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也来吗 凯撒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的秘诀是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实这不是我的功劳 他的基因比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can't take any credit. It's in his genes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你太谦虚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're being very modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的很惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你为凯撒造的家真的很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've built a pretty good home for Caesar, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这维持不了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he won't stay this way for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他马上就会长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to soon grow into.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成一只巨大 有力量的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}a large, powerful, animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.43,0:21:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.41,0:22:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.74,0:22:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love chimpanzees.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也挺怕他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also afraid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕他们也是自然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, it's appropriate to be afraid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒不会伤害别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar will never hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里很快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.82,0:22:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们至少应该给他一点自由活动的空间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can at least give him some open space?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.81,0:22:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这应该不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That would prpbably be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.77,0:22:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 过了桥有个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a place right across the bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,红树林 像天堂一样美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Redwoods. It's a paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要绳索了！没问题 快过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't need a leash! He'll be fine. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:22:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 仅仅为了安全考虑 - 来啊 凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just to be safe. - Come on, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是红树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the redwoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.27,0:23:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它解开 但是你不可以离开我的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I take this off you can not leave my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.37,0:23:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就再也找不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never find you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.99,0:23:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 他在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我简直不能相信！- 怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't believe that! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.51,0:23:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在征得你的同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's asking your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.74,0:23:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个恳求的手势\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a supplicating gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.47,0:23:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 凯撒！去玩吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Caesar! Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.55,0:23:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他多高兴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.15,0:24:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯撒！！- 凯撒！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Caesar!! - Caesar!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.58,0:24:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.73,0:24:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 凯撒 爬上去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Caesar, climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再高一点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.27,0:24:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.72,0:24:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.75,0:24:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 小心点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.54,0:25:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年后
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.18,0:25:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.65,0:25:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.51,0:25:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来碰下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.31,0:25:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是只猩猩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a chimpanzee?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.27,0:25:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.35,0:26:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.31,0:26:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar! Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.36,0:26:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.14,0:26:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别计较 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.03,0:26:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.69,0:26:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.25,0:26:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you getting in?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.64,0:26:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.66,0:26:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.58,0:26:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是宠物吗？不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you pet? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:27:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.07,0:27:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.41,0:27:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒是怎么来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.25,0:27:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.85,0:27:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 这里是我工作的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, this is where I work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.88,0:27:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你出生的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is were you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时你母亲和她的同伴都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother was here with other chimpanzees.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她现在不在这了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's not here, anymore…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.29,0:27:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.46,0:27:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才把你带回家和我一起生活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's why I took home to live with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.70,0:27:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的母亲死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.08,0:28:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 她被注射了药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, she was given medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我给查尔斯注射的药物一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the medicine I give to Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.42,0:28:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把它遗传给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She passed it on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才会这么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带他回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.71,0:28:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, explain it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.39,0:28:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.38,0:28:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让他活命 我把它偷偷带出实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snuck him out of the lab to save his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.20,0:28:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到药效会被母亲遗传给它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea that the effects had been transfered vertically from his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.21,0:28:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从那时起 他就表现出了不可思议地高智商行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, since then, he's been displaying incredible signs intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设计了112号药剂用来修复 但凯撒的表现远超出预期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I designed the 112 to repair, but Caesar's gone way beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:29:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他去年以来的智商表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's his IQ from last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.66,0:29:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在 他的智商提高了一倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since then, it's doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.06,0:29:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.70,0:29:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲曾经不能自理 这药剂让他重获新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was on gone. This drug brought him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没见过他有多么糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never saw how bad he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.80,0:29:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拥有了正常的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has his life again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那凯撒怎么办？- 什么怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And, what about Caesar? - What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么生活下去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he fit in?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.30,0:29:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我… 和我们一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me… with us…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.05,0:29:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这对你来说很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it has been hard for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你在试图操控我们绝对不应该插手的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are trying to control things that were never meant to be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.23,0:29:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,112号药剂是有效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 112 works.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.47,0:29:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意识到你有多疯狂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you realize how you sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.08,0:29:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说它是很棒的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is this is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.50,0:29:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒就是证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar's proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.69,0:29:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So's my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.64,0:29:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 吃点东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, eat your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.08,0:30:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.68,0:30:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.11,0:30:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antibodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.93,0:30:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的免疫系统找到了对抗112病毒的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}His system has found a way to fight the 112 virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.19,0:30:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此它没办法发挥疗效\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that it can't deliver its therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.17,0:30:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的病会更严重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's disease is going to return with a vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.11,0:31:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.20,0:31:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来 马上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.89,0:31:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！离开那！从车里滚出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Get out there! Get out of that car!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.34,0:31:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的在干嘛？从我的车里滚出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing? Get out of my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.80,0:31:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 从我的车里滚出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, get out of my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.01,0:31:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是飞行员！我得赶去机场！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a pilot! I've got to get to the airport!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.83,0:31:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我怎么去那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I gonna get there now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.14,0:31:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我的问题！你到底在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the God-damn question! What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.61,0:31:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有台一模一样的车…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a car just exactly…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.78,0:31:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完蛋了… 警察会来处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done… the police can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.46,0:31:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就待在这！你哪都不能去 先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right there! You aren't going nowhere, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.18,0:32:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会付出代价的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.19,0:32:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的问题 你造成了现在这种局面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your problem, you make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.42,0:32:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你没完！就待在这！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not through with you! Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.38,0:32:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.21,0:32:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.02,0:33:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.42,0:33:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.15,0:33:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.85,0:33:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.06,0:33:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 把那玩意拿下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, take that thing off of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.02,0:33:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那玩意拿下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that thing off of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.19,0:34:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我来它带进去 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll take him in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.58,0:34:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 法院命令扣押他 我们不能放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's under court orders. We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.60,0:34:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系！随他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine! Let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.06,0:34:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好的时候再带他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him in when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.46,0:34:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.30,0:34:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 凯撒 凯撒… 凯撒 凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, Caesar, Caesar… Caesar, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.96,0:34:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不是时候 但一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right now. It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.77,0:34:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就进去看看里面什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just see what it's like inside, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.86,0:34:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.22,0:34:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.75,0:34:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧… 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on… trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.85,0:34:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.19,0:34:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.15,0:35:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来没和其他猩猩相处过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't spent any time with other chimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.52,0:35:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情况我们见多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.42,0:35:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚开始他会有点暴躁敏感 但是我们会让他融入进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be a little skittish at first, but we'll integrate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.07,0:35:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能很快适应环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised how quick they adapt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.30,0:35:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们提供了适宜的生存环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}We provide a stimulating environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.03,0:35:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会在这愉快地生活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to thrive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.54,0:35:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我们签写书面文件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, let's do some paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.42,0:35:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来之前确保把门锁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you lock that door when you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.26,0:35:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.60,0:35:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.59,0:35:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's going to be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.77,0:35:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.54,0:35:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前 你要待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to stay here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.50,0:36:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不… 还不能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No… Not going home right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拖拖拉拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.73,0:36:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,道别拖得越久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer you drag out the good-byes,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.32,0:36:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会变得越难\N{\fnArial\fs30}the harder it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.28,0:36:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能待会再签吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I sign that later?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.07,0:36:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的思念可能会更深\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll probably miss him more than he'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.51,0:36:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好给他几周适应环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd best give him a couple of weeks to get used too the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.12,0:36:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.92,0:36:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.72,0:36:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快会再回来的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming back soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.32,0:36:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来之前打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call ahead, before you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.67,0:36:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.15,0:36:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能救你出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I can get you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.94,0:36:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！来这边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.66,0:37:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.69,0:37:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢猴子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid monkey…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.84,0:37:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不过来？搞定他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you? Come on, make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.59,0:38:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,法庭判决还没下来 因此系统里没有记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Court order hasn't been filed, so it's not in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.10,0:38:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦有消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once it comes through,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.15,0:38:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你收到上诉日期前差不多要90天\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will take about 90 days before you receive an appeal date.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.58,0:38:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 90天？- 没错 先生 90天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 90 days? - Yes, sir, 90 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.24,0:38:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将收到邮件通知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be notified by mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.38,0:38:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是接下来要发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再到你的电脑里好好查查 然后给我个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to go back to your computer, you know, shift things around.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.76,0:38:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切的上诉日期 这周内的 明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're going to get me a date for my appeal, this week, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.57,0:38:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.60,0:38:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.19,0:38:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为除非你照我说的做 我不会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, I'm not moving until you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.22,0:38:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,90天 先生 能有上诉日期你就偷笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}90 days, sir. Be thankful you're talking about court dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.26,0:38:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有弄死你的猩猩已经很幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky they didn't put that animal down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.36,0:38:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证很快把他带回来 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised to get him back soon, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.52,0:38:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.15,0:38:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的免疫系统一直在抵触112号病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's immune system continues to reject the 112 virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.98,0:38:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致基因疗法不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}rendering the gene therapy obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.93,0:38:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的健康状况不断恶化 并且疾病发展迅速\N{\fnArial\fs30}his health is deteriorating, and the disease is progressing rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.21,0:38:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一种更具攻击性的病原体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a more aggressive virus strain,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.64,0:39:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种能更快发生作用的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}a faster delivery method,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.57,0:39:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在这个时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}because at this rate…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.18,0:39:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能同时失去他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.48,0:39:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会失去他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't lose them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.72,0:39:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨… 能聊聊吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi… Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.25,0:39:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我还有会议要参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it fast. I've got a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.20,0:39:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年来你一直在经营GEN-SYS公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ten years you have been running GEN-SYS,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.44,0:39:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,流水线上制造出来的多少种药物可以拯救无数人的生命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how many drugs have come down the pipeline that could save millions of lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.59,0:39:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以改变一切？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could change everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.85,0:39:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.52,0:39:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,ALZ-112号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ALZ-112.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.15,0:39:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了 威尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you, Will?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.50,0:39:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经你是这个实验室的明星 而现在你几乎不露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to be the star of this lab. Now, you hardly ever show.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.25,0:39:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你出现的时候 你也在浪费自己和团队的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when you do, you waste your time and that of your team's.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.30,0:39:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究一种药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}fixating on a drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那些事情发生之后 这研究就不可能有任何前景\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, after what happened, is never ever going to get approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.40,0:39:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,112号药剂很危险 威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 112 is dangerous, Will,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.34,0:40:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且它不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.85,0:40:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用它治好了我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I treated my father with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.24,0:40:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它确实有作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.49,0:40:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.72,0:40:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底做了什么！？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did, what!?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.12,0:40:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,战胜了疾病 正如我们预期的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat the disease, like we predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.43,0:40:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.01,0:40:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一个复杂的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a complication.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.68,0:40:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是否真的起作用了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, does it work or doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.18,0:40:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的病比疗效更来势汹汹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's disease eventually outran the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.85,0:40:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for goodness sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.37,0:40:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,免疫系统会产生抗体来对抗这种病毒组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}The immune system produced antibodies to beat the viral component,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.79,0:40:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它会起作用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.32,0:40:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经研制出了一种病原体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've have already developed a virus strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.60,0:40:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会更具攻击性\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I think will be more aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.68,0:40:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么认为？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.89,0:40:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要让我做些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, let me test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.87,0:40:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.24,0:40:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更多改进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.23,0:40:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,疗效将会比疾病速度更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The applications go beyond the disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.00,0:40:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有数据显示这种疗法可以提高认知系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are indications that show the therapy can improve cognitive functioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.17,0:40:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆能力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}memory quality…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.54,0:40:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.85,0:40:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲不仅仅恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father didn't just recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.62,0:40:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变得更健康了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.72,0:40:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是提高智力水平？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, increased intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.86,0:40:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有定论 但确实是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not conclusive, but yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.82,0:41:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你立刻在猩猩身上实验修复后的112号药剂 越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you, to start testing the revised 112 on chimps, A-S-A-P.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.17,0:41:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你一切你要的东西 只要你立刻开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you whatever you need, but get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.19,0:41:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃晚饭了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner time!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.65,0:41:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大猩猩 灵长类！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Ape, primate!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.64,0:41:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 看到这玩意还不知道吃吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, don't you know food when you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.27,0:41:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得很有趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's funny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.94,0:41:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你什么叫做有趣！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I show you something funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.24,0:42:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上就会知道谁是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll learn who's boss, soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.64,0:42:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还穿着衣服怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.93,0:42:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.92,0:42:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道… 可能会被其他猩猩当作异类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know… May cause problems with the other apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.94,0:42:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.71,0:43:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共十只猩猩 没错吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I counted ten apes, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.10,0:43:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.77,0:43:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 都运到后面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. All the way to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.23,0:43:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们行动太快了 着什么急啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are moving really quick on this. What's the big rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一天复工 你依然在抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}First day back, you're still complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.53,0:43:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴 你好 我是威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba. Hi, I'm Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.02,0:44:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.28,0:44:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.63,0:44:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.22,0:44:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他经历过很多实验 他知道规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been through a whole lot of labs. He knows the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.79,0:44:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能加入吗 看看你们的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I join you, what's our progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.87,0:44:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.49,0:44:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴好面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tighten your masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.44,0:44:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把113号递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass me the 113.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.07,0:44:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏很有力 血压稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse-ox is good, blood pressure is steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.71,0:44:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,药物注射剂 到位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perisol delivery, in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.11,0:44:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放113号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Releasing the 113.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.87,0:45:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有泄露！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.79,0:45:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林 戴好面具！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franklin, get your mask on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.25,0:45:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.70,0:45:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.80,0:45:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.82,0:45:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.13,0:45:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,都起来动一动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.59,0:45:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,都起来运动运动 你们这些懒狒狒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up and do some exercises you lazy baboons!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.58,0:48:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,智力测评结果非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intelligence results are remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.92,0:48:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有不良反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no adverse effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.19,0:48:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,猩猩们有惊人地强大免疫系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes have amazingly strong immune systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.53,0:48:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好好照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.52,0:48:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.12,0:48:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.38,0:48:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙比我还有抵抗力\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are more resiliant than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.35,0:48:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.23,0:49:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤得严重吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seriously injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.27,0:49:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道手语吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know sign language?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.83,0:49:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在马戏团工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked at the circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.68,0:49:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.08,0:49:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 人类不喜欢有智商的猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. Humans do not like intelligent apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.04,0:49:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚要工作到很晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're working late tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.16,0:49:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,GEN-SYS公司还需要三只猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}GEN-SYS needs three more.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.90,0:50:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.12,0:50:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.75,0:50:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.39,0:50:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 把手给我 把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, give me your hand. Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.59,0:50:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 新来的总会被教训一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, the new kid on the block gets picked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.79,0:50:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静 他们做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm. What did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.43,0:50:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯淡！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.73,0:50:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the problem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.51,0:50:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带他离开这里 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking him out of here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.68,0:50:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有法院命令不可以带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without a court order, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.04,0:50:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他再也不是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not yours, anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.30,0:50:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 如果我发现他受到任何形式的虐待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise, if I find out he's been mistreated in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.50,0:50:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让这地方关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have this place shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.21,0:50:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.19,0:51:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不能马上回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, we're not going home, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.24,0:51:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你离开这里的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get you out of here, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.30,0:51:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.09,0:51:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 你一定要相信我 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, you have to trust me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.60,0:51:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,探视结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this visit's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.77,0:51:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.98,0:51:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.34,0:52:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走啦！我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move it! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.48,0:53:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有成百上千只猩猩！好像你有了私人动物园一样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are hundreds of them! Looks like you're own private zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.65,0:53:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是这些毛茸茸家伙的监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather like a prison for hairy dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.11,0:53:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会看电视？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They watch TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.70,0:53:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们管这叫提升\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call it enrichment.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.18,0:53:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这只真可爱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, this one's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.35,0:53:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.70,0:53:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫柯妮丽娅 她是母的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, name's Cornelia. It's a she.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.25,0:53:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.09,0:53:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠太近！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.99,0:53:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只把我吓得半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one scared me half to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.96,0:53:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只大家伙叫毛里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That big guy is called, Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.20,0:53:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.15,0:53:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我给你看点有意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I'll show you something fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.68,0:53:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.51,0:53:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.83,0:53:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 下个就是你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.04,0:53:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.35,0:53:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子 我们在这里花了太多时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spent too much time in here, as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:53:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.67,0:54:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.37,0:54:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿兰 他不是好惹的 他觉得自己很特别之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Alan, he's a pain in the ass. He thinks he's special, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.75,0:54:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉摸不透的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.66,0:54:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.66,0:54:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他在想些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's thinking or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.02,0:54:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他抓住他的喉咙了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, he's got him by the throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.43,0:54:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.17,0:54:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.43,0:54:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.25,0:54:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.32,0:54:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过不要靠太近的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to get too close, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.59,0:54:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 各位 我们出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.99,0:59:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事不需要被改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things aren't meant be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.45,0:59:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要接受它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.35,0:59:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.58,0:59:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.14,0:59:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.92,0:59:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再做些113号药剂的试验 我们在做准备…\N{\fnArial\fs30}More 113 trials. We're just prepping…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们必须先分析科巴的血液！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, we have to analyze Koba's blood work first!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.25,0:59:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林知道流程 他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franklin knows this. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.23,0:59:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他请了两天病假\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out sick for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.90,0:59:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有批准这次试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't authorized this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.43,0:59:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.44,0:59:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我批准的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.00,0:59:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同意在一只猩猩上做保守测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed to test sparingly on one subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.44,0:59:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只猩猩太令人吃惊了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, that one subject is stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.11,0:59:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是种病毒 我们不知道它对人类的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a virus. We don't know the human related effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.93,0:59:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,药物起作用了 威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drug works, Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.63,0:59:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.05,0:59:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始 科巴以15步的满分成绩完成了卢卡斯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters, Koba scored a perfect 15 on the Lucas Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次测试的结果都验证了它的有效性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every test result verifies its effectiveness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.23,1:00:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能再测试了 - 你在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No more tests. - What are you…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.84,1:00:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们弄明白我们在做什么之前 不能继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until we have a better understanding of what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.86,1:00:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我会明确告诉你我们做的是什么 听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll tell you exactly what we do. Look…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.89,1:00:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.78,1:00:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦一下！把猩猩放回笼子里 温柔点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me! Put the ape back in the cage. Be gentle.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.49,1:00:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔 我明确告诉你我们在这里做的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, I'll tell you exactly what we're dealing with, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.72,1:00:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在研究一种药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with a drug that is worth more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.98,1:00:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它比我们研究合成的任何药物都更有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}than everything else we are developing, combined.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.21,1:00:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你创造历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make history,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.16,1:00:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挣钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make money.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.63,1:00:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不就是我们的安排吗？- 不！这有风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Isn't that our arrangement? - No! There are risks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.14,1:00:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别跟我讲风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you tell me about risks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.03,1:00:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给你自己爸爸吃试验阶段的药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give your own father an experimental drug.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.26,1:00:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一通电话就能结束你的职业生涯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could finish your career with one phone call.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.85,1:00:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你省点麻烦吧 我退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll save you the trouble. I quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.57,1:00:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你 我们也会继续的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will proceed without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.63,1:00:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着… 你不知道自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look… You do not know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.07,1:00:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些测试应该被限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}These tests need to be contained.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.07,1:00:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道113号药剂是否稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea if the 113 is stable,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.36,1:00:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会对人类造成怎样的伤害…\N{\fnArial\fs30}what kind of damage it can do to people…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.00,1:00:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们先在猩猩上做试验… 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is why we test it on chimps… isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.51,1:01:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德曼博士 是我 富兰克林！我要跟你谈谈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Rodman, it's, me, Franklin! I need to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.28,1:01:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以开门吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you come to the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.39,1:01:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.08,1:01:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.49,1:01:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.24,1:01:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起… 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry… I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.12,1:01:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是想收买我吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be trying to entrap me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.13,1:01:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个… 我不敢说同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… I can't say that I approve.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.90,1:01:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是人 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not people, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.68,1:01:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放不放他走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna to let him go or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.72,1:02:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒… 嘿 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar… hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.56,1:02:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.68,1:02:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.11,1:02:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我们真的要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're really going.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.03,1:02:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.00,1:02:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对… 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah… Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.62,1:02:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.23,1:02:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜和自己的家相比 他更喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess he likes it better here with his own kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.50,1:05:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么发曲奇饼 火箭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why cookies, Rocket?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.43,1:05:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只猴子… 很弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single monkey… is weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.19,1:05:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴子们聚在一起… 就有力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkeys together… a force.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴子都是没脑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkeys are stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.23,1:06:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 罗德尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Rodney,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.98,1:06:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又把水管留在中房了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave the hose out in the atrium, again?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.04,1:06:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？没有！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.97,1:08:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.62,1:08:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.82,1:09:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在发射八个月后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight months after its launch,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.16,1:09:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球的首个飞向火星的载人飞船…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth's first manned space flight to Mars…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.61,1:09:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会逃避 我说的是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't dodging. I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.52,1:09:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果不是我拿的曲奇饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, if I've didn't take the cookies,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.93,1:09:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能是谁干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, who the hell did?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.75,1:09:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, I do not know…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.00,1:09:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你们俩傻子别闹了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Will you two morons knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.48,1:09:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.78,1:09:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球表面有水 这样才能维持生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covered in water and therefore able to sustain life.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.21,1:09:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的猩猩房都比你俩太平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get more peace in the God-damned ape house.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.02,1:09:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 对不起！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.41,1:10:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林先生 我是多蒂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Franklin, it's Dottie!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.03,1:11:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林先生… 有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Franklin… Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.38,1:11:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.73,1:11:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德尼 立刻到猩猩放风的地方来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rodney, get to the platform, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.06,1:11:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rodney!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.18,1:12:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的以为你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you think you're doing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.97,1:12:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.83,1:12:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.50,1:12:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到你的笼子里去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in your cage!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.77,1:12:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在警告你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.16,1:12:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊 进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, get!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.28,1:12:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.34,1:12:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你自找的！回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you get! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.61,1:12:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.62,1:12:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭猴子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.02,1:13:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把臭爪子松开 你个脏猩猩！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your stinking paw off me, you damn dirty ape!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.23,1:13:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.85,1:13:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.72,1:13:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.32,1:13:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.53,1:14:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.28,1:14:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会打死你们每一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll beat each and everyone of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.54,1:15:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛琳 你去过凯撒的房间吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caroline, have you been up to Caesar's room?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.26,1:15:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人接\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's answering.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.91,1:16:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰登！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Landon!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.39,1:17:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.03,1:17:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.42,1:17:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.92,1:17:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.21,1:17:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什… 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you…what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.41,1:17:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的猩猩… 他说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ape… he spoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.83,1:18:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.91,1:18:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.55,1:18:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会打死你们每一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll beat each and everyone of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.27,1:18:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要有人联系旧金山警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need someone to coordinate with the S.F.P.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.98,1:18:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们 有人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them we got a fatality.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.29,1:18:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.01,1:18:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where he's headed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.72,1:18:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.12,1:18:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.89,1:19:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacobs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.82,1:19:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布斯先生 我是威尔团队的琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Jacobs, It's Linda from Will's team.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.08,1:19:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 有可怕的事情发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, something terrible has happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.98,1:19:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,富兰克林死于病毒感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franklin is dead from a viral infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.98,1:19:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.80,1:19:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吸入过113号药剂 它对猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was exposed to the 113. It does something.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.23,1:19:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有副作用 对人类却有\N{\fnArial\fs30}to people that it doesn't do to apes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.08,1:19:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须穿过城市 横过大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to go through the city and across the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.76,1:19:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布斯先生？雅各布斯先生 你在听吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Jacobs? Mr. Jacobs, are you…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.93,1:19:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.41,1:20:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史蒂芬·雅各布斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Steven Jacobs!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.02,1:20:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处都是猩猩 我得上直升机！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's full of apes in there. I gotta get in the air!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.28,1:20:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须有能力毁灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be able to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.72,1:20:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事就相信我吧！好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, trust me on this! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.78,1:20:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该把相机准备好 一般来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to get your cameras ready. Normally,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.02,1:20:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙是非常害羞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}these guys are quit shy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.24,1:21:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去了北边的公园！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going the park, on the north side!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.14,1:21:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到领头的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the lead!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.35,1:21:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要抓着按钮！按钮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta hold the button! The button!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.62,1:21:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被引领了 这些猩猩比你想的要聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're being led. These apes are smarter than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.63,1:21:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有一个领袖！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got a leader!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.63,1:23:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟他们说我堵车了 找个好点的理由！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not tell them I am stuck in traffic. Make up with something smarter!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.97,1:23:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.24,1:23:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.64,1:23:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在桥上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.22,1:23:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想去红杉树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to get to the redwoods.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.26,1:23:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山警局 一号直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}SFPD, Police 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.81,1:23:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是空中指挥部\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Air Ops,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.53,1:23:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁南端桥头 那些部队的情况怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}seal of south end. What's the status of those units?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.03,1:23:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备就绪 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.13,1:23:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他们到了你那里 就拦住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as they reach you, block them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.40,1:24:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,北端 我们会把他们赶到你那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}North side, we're going to push them right to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.52,1:24:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我们已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. We're ready for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.36,1:24:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,北端封锁 他们绝对不能通过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The north side is blocked. They'll never get through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.87,1:24:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他们进入封锁区域 我们就干掉他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as they hit the gap, we'll take them out!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.18,1:24:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能直接杀死他们吗？- 就像朝桶里的鱼开枪一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can just shoot them? - Like shooting fish in a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.65,1:24:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.87,1:24:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把车开回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that thing around!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.91,1:24:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离开大桥 先生 - 我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off the bridge, sir. - I can't…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.67,1:24:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你不明白 离开大桥 马上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. Get off this bridge, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.87,1:24:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里被封锁了 出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an evacuation. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.42,1:24:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有市民安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the civilians, clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.75,1:24:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.69,1:24:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那些人离开大桥！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put these people off the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.22,1:25:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备就绪 城市骑兵！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by, city mounted units!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.89,1:25:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会对猩猩进行大屠杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna slaughter them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.90,1:25:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna to get Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.19,1:25:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.79,1:25:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.60,1:25:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要上我的车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get to my car!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.14,1:25:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.31,1:25:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！我必须上我的车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go me! I have to get my car!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.65,1:26:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们往北赶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push 'em north!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.84,1:26:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.41,1:27:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们会在雾中跟丢他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, we're going to lose them in the fog.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.17,1:27:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.06,1:27:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪？我没看见他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they? I don't see them!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.86,1:27:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,北端防护队 你们有看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}CHP North, do you have a visual?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.43,1:27:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 长官 没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.22,1:28:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开保险！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safety's off!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.52,1:28:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止射击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.92,1:29:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.22,1:29:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.58,1:30:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他！他是领袖！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him! That's the leader!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.27,1:30:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出现了！干掉他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in sight! Put 'em down!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.81,1:31:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.93,1:31:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.96,1:32:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓我的手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.97,1:32:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come on…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.34,1:32:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.28,1:32:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不救你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.27,1:32:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.70,1:32:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.73,1:33:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.10,1:33:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.03,1:34:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒… 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar… I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.49,1:34:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.64,1:34:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这必须结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.26,1:34:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.15,1:34:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们有什么能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.10,1:34:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.52,1:34:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你回家 我会保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you come home, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.31,1:35:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar is home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.91,1:35:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar's home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.32,1:35:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
